  "method": "Root opened original PNGs with view_image. The16 isolated source originals were viewed at their final-producer paths; gallery copies have identical raw hashes. No image generation, crop, retouch, resizing or composition was applied to delivered PNGs.",
  "observations": [
    "Normal Light/Dark pairs share structure, warm/ink page colors, cards, readable status and green actions; approved phase1 source layouts remain unchanged.",
    "Home has two real historical-scope counts, without an unimplemented cost aggregate. Empty Room home has one primary first-record action.",
    "Subscription list/current/history retain real groups and metrics; details distinguish purchased standard days, elapsed paid days and current plan. Supplemental current-plan/history images supply content below first viewport.",
    "At system360dp/font2.0, content reflows and scrolls; toolbar add does not overlay data cards. More menu and discard/delete confirmations have readable reachable choices. Native numerical keyboard, raw1.234 and original precision error are visible in source PNGs.",
    "The standalone injected error presentation hosts have no production Scaffold/system-bar adaptation; their white/default system-bar surrounds are not evidence of MainActivity Dark bars. Original PNGs are deliberately retained and labelled.",
    "The image named final-native-ime-submit-error-light shows the viewport immediately after invalid Save; the actual precision error is established in final-pressure-validation-light/dark and final-native-ime-amount-dark, not inferred from its filename.",
    "Some long QA names and the subscription back label wrap at200%; this is visible in original stress images. Entire native mode/state/theme cross-product and complete TalkBack are not claimed."
  ],
